Tạo class `StorageStats` thống kê dữ liệu storage:

- Constructor `StorageStats(List<Map<String, dynamic>> entries)`
- Method `int get totalEntries` — tổng số entries
- Method `int get totalSizeBytes` — tổng size (dùng `toString().length` approximation cho mỗi value)
- Method `Map<String, int> get fieldCounts` — đếm số fields trong mỗi entry:
  - VD: [{a: 1, b: 2}, {a: 3}] → {a: 2, b: 1}
- Method `List<String> get allFields` — danh sách unique fields (sorted)
- Method `String get averageSize` — average size per entry, format: "X.X KB" hoặc "X.X B"
- Method `String get largestEntry` — entry có size lớn nhất, format: "Entry #{index} ({size}B)"
- Method `Map<String, dynamic> getSummary()`:
  - {totalEntries: ..., totalSizeBytes: ..., fieldCount: ..., averageSize: ...}
- Method `describe()` trả về "StorageStats({totalEntries} entries, {totalSizeBytes}B, {fieldCount} fields)"

Ví dụ:
```
final entries = [
  {'name': 'Alice', 'age': 25},
  {'name': 'Bob', 'age': 30, 'city': 'HN'}
];
final stats = StorageStats(entries);
stats.totalEntries → 2
stats.allFields → ['age', 'city', 'name']
stats.fieldCounts → {name: 2, age: 2, city: 1}
```

